    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197330/extras/ab1bc89c432df24d48454318e36820a3.poster.avif?t=1737455689\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197330/extras/ab1bc89c432df24d48454318e36820a3.webm?t=1737455689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Card Nova Hyper is a deckbuilder card battler with both a story and a roguelike mode. Get new cards, strategize new decks, and power up to the point clothes explode! But can you beat the almighty Queen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Battle \u2192 get new cards \u2192 tweak your deck \u2192 repeat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197330/extras/fc2b98b0b24436e7fbc6be183e18de3b.poster.avif?t=1737455689\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197330/extras/fc2b98b0b24436e7fbc6be183e18de3b.webm?t=1737455689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197330/extras/fc2b98b0b24436e7fbc6be183e18de3b.mp4?t=1737455689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Employ your tactics to best your opponents. With this, you will get money. With money, you can buy and upgrade cards. You can then use those to cleverly strengthen your deck. Suddenly you are beating stronger enemies and getting even more gold. Cycle repeats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Turn the tide of the duel by going into Nova Nova!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197330/extras/a3d57b0086c81c88d2c319c8feb99280.poster.avif?t=1737455689\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197330/extras/a3d57b0086c81c88d2c319c8feb99280.webm?t=1737455689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When things get rough, you can activate Nova Hyper! This power-up mode will give you various bonuses in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But be aware as the opponent is also able to use it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Meet rivals and friends on the journey to face the Queen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197330/extras/71cf886f195bdf514f9e343e9d7d6b3b.poster.avif?t=1737455689\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197330/extras/71cf886f195bdf514f9e343e9d7d6b3b.webp?t=1737455689\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A rich cast of characters awaits you, with their reasons for standing in your way. Defeat and get to know each of them as you make your way to the showdown with the Queen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197330/extras/ab1bc89c432df24d48454318e36820a3.poster.avif?t=1737455689\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197330/extras/ab1bc89c432df24d48454318e36820a3.webm?t=1737455689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Card Nova Hyper is a deckbuilder card battler with both a story and a roguelike mode. Get new cards, strategize new decks, and power up to the point clothes explode! But can you beat the almighty Queen?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Battle \u2192 get new cards \u2192 tweak your deck \u2192 repeat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197330/extras/fc2b98b0b24436e7fbc6be183e18de3b.poster.avif?t=1737455689\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197330/extras/fc2b98b0b24436e7fbc6be183e18de3b.webm?t=1737455689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197330/extras/fc2b98b0b24436e7fbc6be183e18de3b.mp4?t=1737455689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Employ your tactics to best your opponents. With this, you will get money. With money, you can buy and upgrade cards. You can then use those to cleverly strengthen your deck. Suddenly you are beating stronger enemies and getting even more gold. Cycle repeats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Turn the tide of the duel by going into Nova Nova!!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197330/extras/a3d57b0086c81c88d2c319c8feb99280.poster.avif?t=1737455689\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197330/extras/a3d57b0086c81c88d2c319c8feb99280.webm?t=1737455689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When things get rough, you can activate Nova Hyper! This power-up mode will give you various bonuses in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But be aware as the opponent is also able to use it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Meet rivals and friends on the journey to face the Queen</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197330/extras/71cf886f195bdf514f9e343e9d7d6b3b.poster.avif?t=1737455689\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2197330/extras/71cf886f195bdf514f9e343e9d7d6b3b.webp?t=1737455689\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A rich cast of characters awaits you, with their reasons for standing in your way. Defeat and get to know each of them as you make your way to the showdown with the Queen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "short_description": "Experience sexy cloth-bursting duels in this captivating Tokyo-based card battler RPG. Collect, upgrade, and evolve cards to build the perfect deck. Encounter a cast of irresistibly attractive characters and get ready to leave your opponents in awe and your wardrobe in ruins!",
